      ],
      "text": "The Agent Core runs a loop where a user prompt goes to the Planner for a step plan, the Researcher extracts search queries, web results are formatted, and the Coder generates code saved to disk; follow-up prompts route through an Action agent to Runner, Feature, Patcher, or Reporter agents."
    },
