        "slc_11786ab8e1e9b415c840f0f96d8130c5c639cd01348e3e81e499ffd7bb75e172"
      ],
      "text": "Stated design principles include modularity via specialized agents, pluggable LLMs and services, persistence for pause/resume and auditing, and real-time transparency of the agent's thought process to the user."
    },
